<h1>Stein of Moggok</h1>
<DIV CLASS="itemdesc">
<b>Stein of Moggok</b><br>
MAGIC ITEM&nbsp;&nbsp;LORE ITEM&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
Slot: PRIMARY&nbsp;&nbsp;SECONDARY&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
<br>
Charges: 5<br>
DEX: +5&nbsp;&nbsp;INT: +10&nbsp;&nbsp;HP: +10&nbsp;&nbsp;SV DISEASE: +25&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
Effect: Light Healing&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
WT: 2.5&nbsp;&nbsp;Size: MEDIUM<br>
Class: ALL&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>
